  a owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:label "phases" ;
  rdfs:comment "Represents the normal network phasing condition. If the attribute is missing, three phases (ABC) shall be assumed, except for terminals of grounding classes (specializations of EarthFaultCompensator, GroundDisconnector, and Ground) which will be assumed to be N. Therefore, phase code ABCN is explicitly declared when needed, e.g. for star point grounding equipment. The phase code on terminals connecting same ConnectivityNode or same TopologicalNode as well as for equipment between two terminals shall"@en ;
  cims:multiplicity cims:M:0..1 ;
  rdfs:domain cim:Terminal ;
  rdfs:range cim:PhaseCode .

