nc:SchedulingArea ;
  rdfs:label "SchedulingArea" ;
  rdfs:comment "An area where production and/or consumption of energy can be forecasted, scheduled and measured. The area is operated by only one system operator, typically a Transmission System Operator (TSO). The area can consist of a sub area, which has the same definition as the main area, but it can be operated by another system operator (typically Distributed System Operator (DSO) or a Closed Distributed System Operator (CDSO)). This includes microgrid concept. A substation is the smallest grouping that can"@en ;
  rdfs:subClassOf cim:PowerSystemResource .

